<%- include('partials/header') %><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow eyebrow-accent">About FixMitra</span><h1>Home care should feel organized, transparent and dependable.</h1><p>FixMitra brings customer requests, professional assignments, quotations and progress updates into one clear workflow.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><span class="eyebrow">Our purpose</span><h2>A better operating system for everyday home services</h2><p class="lead-small">Customers should not need to manage repairs through scattered calls and uncertain follow-ups. FixMitra gives each request a secure reference, structured information and a traceable status history.</p><p>The platform also gives administrators practical control over services, illustrative prices, technician availability, assignments, quotations and performance reports.</p></div><div class="values-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Clarity first</h3><p>Every request, price and status is presented in plain language.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Professional control</h3><p>Assignments and quotations remain administrator-managed.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Privacy by design</h3><p>Customers can access only their own account records.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h3>Honest states</h3><p>Unconfigured messaging and payments are never presented as completed.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section section-soft"><div class="container center-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Service area</span><h2><%= settings.service_area %></h2><p>Availability is reviewed for each request. FixMitra does not publish a fictional street address or unsupported coverage claim.</p><a class="button" href="/book">Create a service request</a></div></section><%- include('partials/footer') %>